# lean24b.env -- the lean ISPD 2024 pipeline, variant L2D (HISTORY_COST_SWEEP.md Part 115),
# layered on @standard.env @standard24.env. Drops the stages that cost
# runtime without helping the 2024 score: the tree rebuild and wirelength
# recovery (made ariane_68_rank 0.6% worse) and layer assignment's
# negotiation rounds (+-0.01% for 2-3x the time). Keeps the pattern stage,
# the 2D stages (slow tier, region, refinement, fallback), layer
# assignment's first round, and the 3D pattern passes.
PD8ROUTE_REBUILD=0
PD7ROUTE_WL=0
NV2ROUTE_VIA_ROUNDS=0
